      "message": "**2. Incomplete Coverage of Mocks**\nYou have declared a mock for `focal_algo_version` (`DECLARE_FAKE_VOID_FUNC(focal_algo_version, uint8_t *);`), and properly reset it in `ft98xx_alg_before`, but there doesn\u0027t seem to be a test validating that the driver correctly queries or exposes the algorithm version.\n\n* **Suggestion:** Add a brief test case (e.g., `test_version_query`) to verify this functionality if the version string is exposed via the Zephyr fingerprint subsystem API.",
